  clock: 2  # a281
  nonce: a281  # a281
  message: "Pass 17 FFFFFF re-confirmation: ran 'hypergumbo explain auto-pr --input /tmp/hg-dogfood-s11/bm.json --provenance' and the same without --provenance. Output was BYTE-IDENTICAL (3116 lines each, diff produced no output). The --provenance flag is a complete no-op in the explain code path, not just 'missing extra output'. Suggested fix: either remove the flag or wire it to emit derived_from chains under each Calls/Called by entry. Sample target: scripts/auto-pr."  # a281
